{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"nix","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Nix","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Nix (.nix).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"nix","name":"Nix","extensions":[".nix"],"grammar":"grammars/nix.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Nix","path":"snippets/nix.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/nix.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"''\",\n      \"end\": \"''\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{[^}]*\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"(?:\\\\.{1,2}|~)?/[\\\\w./+-]+\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[A-Za-z_][\\\\w'-]*(?:\\\\.[A-Za-z_][\\\\w'-]*)*(?=\\\\s*=[^=])\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"->|//|\\\\+\\\\+|\\\\?|@\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:inherit|assert|import|else|then|with|let|rec|if|in|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:builtins\\\\.attrNames|lib\\\\.mkEnableOption|builtins\\\\.toString|builtins\\\\.filter|pkgs\\\\.writeText|builtins\\\\.map|lib\\\\.mkOption|lib\\\\.mkIf)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/nix.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Flake\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"flake\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{\",\n      \"  description = \\\"${1:A flake}\\\";\",\n      \"  inputs.nixpkgs.url = \\\"github:NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-unstable\\\";\",\n      \"  outputs = { self, nixpkgs }: {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"  };\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A flake skeleton\"\n  },\n  \"Shell\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"shell\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"pkgs.mkShell {\",\n      \"  packages = with pkgs; [ ${1:git} ];\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A dev shell\"\n  },\n  \"Let in\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"let\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let\",\n      \"  ${1:name} = ${2:value};\",\n      \"in\",\n      \"  $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"let ... in\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{ ${1:pkgs}, ... }:\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Nix\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Nix.\n\n## Files\n\n`.nix`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `flake` | A flake skeleton |\n| `shell` | A dev shell |\n| `let` | let ... in |\n| `fn` | A function |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}